	Go down to the deepest level you can find in Gehennom, then search for
a spot where the ground vibrates.  You can only find it by standing on it;
levitating over it won't work, nor is there any way to detect it at a distance
(a'la gold detection or object detection).  Next, ensure that all your tools
(Bell, Book, Candles, and Candelabrum) are not cursed.  Personal experience
has shown that a wand of cancellation will remove curses from the Bell,
Candelabrum, and the candles.  I'm not sure about the Book.

	Put the candles in the Candelabrum and light them.  Then, while
standing on the vibrating spot, ring the bell and read the book.  This should
open the passage into Moloch's Inner Sanctum.  What you do beyond here is up
to you.

